WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.300
Alright!

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.733
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:12.400
A.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.100
Sun,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:13.800
B.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.467
Jupiter,

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.167
C.

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:15.833
Mars,

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:17.233
or D.

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:17.900
Venus?

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.267
Five seconds!

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.267
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:27.433
It's...

00:00:27.433 --> 00:00:27.900
A,

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:28.400
sun!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:28.867
Jupiter,

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:29.367
Mars,

00:00:29.367 --> 00:00:31.767
and Venus are all planets.

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:34.200
The sun is a star,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.600
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:38.167
So,

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:40.200
are you smart or fart?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.633
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:43.833
find your rank!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.333
So,

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:46.733
how did you do?

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:48.100
Comment your score below,

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.467
and follow for more!
